# GitHub Linguist 语言统计修正
# gavel = Spring Boot（Java）后端 + Vue 管理端
# 问题：已构建的前端产物被提交进仓库，导致语言统计被 JavaScript 淹没
#   （java 约 214 KB vs js 约 10.3 MB，chunk-vendors.js 单文件即有数 MB）
# 修正：将构建产物与第三方前端资源排除出语言统计

# --- 前端构建产物（bundled/minified）---
server/src/main/resources/admin/admin/dist/** linguist-generated
server/src/main/resources/static/** linguist-generated
**/dist/** linguist-generated
**/*.min.js linguist-generated
**/*.min.css linguist-generated

# --- 前端依赖与源码（属于管理端，不计入后端语言占比）---
server/src/main/resources/admin/admin/node_modules/** linguist-vendored
server/src/main/resources/admin/admin/src/** linguist-vendored
server/src/main/resources/admin/admin/public/** linguist-vendored
**/node_modules/** linguist-vendored

# --- 锁文件 ---
**/package-lock.json linguist-generated
**/yarn.lock linguist-generated

# --- 文档 ---
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
